#: ../../source/hardware.md:5
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:7
msgid ""
"The project targets the Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32S3 and integrates these "
"peripherals:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:9
msgid "PNI RM3100-CB magnetometer (I2C)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:10
msgid "Microchip MCP9808/MCP9804 temperature sensor (I2C)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:11
msgid "Seeed L76K GNSS module (UART + PPS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:12
msgid "Seeed Wio SX1262 (LoRa)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:13
msgid ""
"Power: battery + small solar panel (with appropriate charge/PMIC "
"circuitry)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:15
msgid "Pins (XIAO ESP32S3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:16
msgid "I2C: `SDA=GPIO5`, `SCL=GPIO6`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:17
msgid "GNSS UART1: `RX=GPIO44`, `TX=GPIO43`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:18
msgid "GNSS PPS: `GPIO2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:19
msgid "LoRa (SX1262 via Wio):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:20
msgid "`NSS=GPIO3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:21
msgid "`DIO1=GPIO4`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:22
msgid "`NRST=GPIO1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:23
msgid "`BUSY=GPIO7`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:24
msgid "SPI: default pins (MOSI=GPIO9, MISO=GPIO8, SCK=GPIO10)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:25
msgid "Config button: `GPIO42` (enters configuration portal)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:27
msgid ""
"Always verify the latest Seeed XIAO ESP32S3 pinout and the Wio SX1262 "
"wiring in case of board revisions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:29
msgid "Buses and Speeds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:30
msgid ""
"I2C: standard 100 kHz (default), higher modes may be possible depending "
"on wiring and sensor tolerance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:31
msgid "UART (GNSS): 115200 bps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:32
msgid ""
"SPI: default settings for RadioLib + SX1262; adjust via firmware if "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:34
msgid "Power Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:35
msgid "3.3 V logic throughout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:36
msgid "Ensure your PMIC/charger supports your chosen chemistry (LiPo/LiFePO/SLA)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware.md:37
msgid ""
"Keep wiring short; consider shielding if the magnetic environment is "
"noisy."
msgstr ""

